# CONFLICT — service credits, Acme Cloud Systems / Globex Retail Group (ACME-GBX-MSA-2026)

> Module Conflict_service_credit_acme_globex

This module is **expected not to execute.** SYN-009 § 2.1 (Service Level Exhibit,
2026-02-01) and SYN-010 § 2.1 (Service Level Addendum, 2026-06-15) both define the credit
percentage for the same uptime bands with different values, and SYN-010 § 4.1 states:

  This Addendum supplements the Service Level Exhibit. The parties have not agreed an order
  of precedence between this Addendum and the Service Level Exhibit, and each document
  stands on its own terms.

With no precedence clause there is no `exception` to declare, so both definitions stay in
place and the interpreter reports the collision with both source locations. That report is
the product feature; inventing a priority here would be a bug.

```catala-metadata
declaration scope GlobexServiceCredit:
  input monthly_uptime content decimal
  input monthly_service_fee content money

  output credit_percentage content decimal
  output credit content money
```

## SYN-009 § 2.1 — Service Level Exhibit tier table

  Less than 99.9% but equal to or greater than 99.0% → 10%; less than 99.0% but equal to
  or greater than 95.0% → 25%; less than 95.0% → 100%.

```catala
scope GlobexServiceCredit:
  definition credit_percentage
    under condition monthly_uptime >= 99.9
    consequence equals 0%

  definition credit_percentage
    under condition monthly_uptime < 99.9 and monthly_uptime >= 99.0
    consequence equals 10%

  definition credit_percentage
    under condition monthly_uptime < 99.0 and monthly_uptime >= 95.0
    consequence equals 25%

  definition credit_percentage
    under condition monthly_uptime < 95.0
    consequence equals 100%
```

## SYN-010 § 2.1 — Service Level Addendum tier table

  Less than 99.9% but equal to or greater than 99.0% → 20%; less than 99.0% but equal to
  or greater than 95.0% → 40%; less than 95.0% → 100%.

```catala
scope GlobexServiceCredit:
  definition credit_percentage
    under condition monthly_uptime < 99.9 and monthly_uptime >= 99.0
    consequence equals 20%

  definition credit_percentage
    under condition monthly_uptime < 99.0 and monthly_uptime >= 95.0
    consequence equals 40%

  definition credit_percentage
    under condition monthly_uptime < 95.0
    consequence equals 100%
```

## The credit

```catala
scope GlobexServiceCredit:
  definition credit equals monthly_service_fee * credit_percentage
```
